OL,3,GNEWSALung cancer screening sees 10,000
OL,4,Apeople take part
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost 10,000 people across Shropshire
OL,7,Fhave had a free lung health check as
OL,8,Fpart of a programme to detect lung
OL,9,Fcancer earlier.
OL,11,FThe NHS Lung Cancer Screening
OL,12,FProgramme, which began rolling out
OL,13,Facross the county in December, starting
OL,14,Fin the Telford area, targets residents
OL,15,Faged 55 to 74 who currently smoke or
OL,16,Fhave smoked in the past.
OL,18,FAbout 4,500 people were identified as
OL,19,Fhigh risk during the checks, and went
OL,20,Fon to receive a CT scan, with 29 lung
OL,21,Fcancers being discovered as a result.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
