OL,3,GNEWSALung cancer screening sees 10,000
OL,4,Apeople take part
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe programme has been praised by
OL,7,Fpatients, including one woman who
OL,8,Fexplained she felt "completely well"
OL,9,Fwithout any symptoms before her lung
OL,10,Fcancer was detected.
